        <dc:title>Intercultural Contacts in the Medieval Mediterranean: Studies in Honour of David Jacoby</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>These essays by medievalists touch upon many aspects of intercultural links in the medieval Mediterranean, covering not only strictly cultural and religious</dcterms:abstract>
