        <dc:title>Urban women, investment, and the commercial revolution of the Middle Ages</dc:title>
        <dc:date>1999</dc:date>
        <z:language>English</z:language>
        <dc:description>Explores ways in which women made investments in the growing money economy, concentrating on northern Italy (particularly Genoa), but with comparisons with cities in northern Europe. Consolidated bibliography at pp. 391-401.</dc:description>
