        <dc:title>Vini della Liguria nel secolo XV</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>The author makes use of some passages of the Descriptio orae ligusticae by J. Bracelli (1448) and of private letters written in the years 1422 and 1425/ 26 to bring into evidence the importance of the Ligurian wine-production (Moscato, Vernaccia, Rossese, wines of the Cinque Terre) during the fifteenth century.</dcterms:abstract>
        <dc:date>1973</dc:date>
        <z:language>Italian</z:language>
        <dc:description>.</dc:description>
